    <string name="tc_ui_direct_audio">Direct audio (native, no PulseAudio)</string>
    <string name="tc_ui_direct_audio_hint">Plays sound straight through Android AAudio via an ALSA plugin in the guest (libasound_module_pcm_tinyaudio.so). Fixes dropouts and crackling in emulators such as PPSSPP and Dolphin. Wine, SDL and ALSA apps use it automatically; PulseAudio is only started for the virtual mic. Applies on next launch.</string>
    <string name="tc_ui_direct_audio_alsa">Force ALSA audio driver</string>
    <string name="tc_ui_direct_audio_alsa_hint">Makes SDL, Wine and other apps use the ALSA driver directly (SDL_AUDIODRIVER=alsa) instead of auto-detecting. Only works when Direct audio is on. Applies on next launch.</string>
